{"about_the_game":"Start your hobby horsing adventure completely for free! Create your own horse on a stick and test yourself on your first obstacle courses. Win your first trophies, develop skills and feel the atmosphere of this unique discipline!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIY for the start!</h2>You don't need a stable or a real horse - just your imagination and room! In the First Ride, you can design your first hobby horse and start training on selected routes. Discover how much joy a horse you have created yourself can give!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/77bc391e7faa3821e5e5f97f6e360707.poster.avif?t=1771509191\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/77bc391e7faa3821e5e5f97f6e360707.webm?t=1771509191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/77bc391e7faa3821e5e5f97f6e360707.mp4?t=1771509191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First obstacles, first successes!</h2>Grab your horse and set off on basic obstacle courses - from the gym to forest paths. Test your skills, learn new tricks and earn your first achievements. Open the map and choose the route you want to cover!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/811c634ca2edac7232acf4ed2f47b2e1.poster.avif?t=1771509191\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/811c634ca2edac7232acf4ed2f47b2e1.webm?t=1771509191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/811c634ca2edac7232acf4ed2f47b2e1.mp4?t=1771509191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First jumps, first power-ups!</h2>During the ride, you will find various boosters that will help you overcome even the most difficult obstacles. Try out the basic powers and see how far you can go with your horse!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/2b46821345238f83f99d78eb26ee8243.poster.avif?t=1771509191\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/2b46821345238f83f99d78eb26ee8243.webm?t=1771509191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/2b46821345238f83f99d78eb26ee8243.mp4?t=1771509191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Personalization for a good start!</h2>Choose the color and shape of your first hobby horse! In the free version, you have basic personalization options that will allow you to stand out on the track.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/c5636752f256b9c5cccb88c0a63e7642.poster.avif?t=1771509191\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/c5636752f256b9c5cccb88c0a63e7642.webm?t=1771509191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/extras/c5636752f256b9c5cccb88c0a63e7642.mp4?t=1771509191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try it for free - love hobby horsing!</h2>Hobby Horse: First Ride is the perfect start for anyone who wants to feel the atmosphere of hobby horsing. Start your adventure today and discover how much fun jumping over obstacles on a horse you created yourself can be!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Get the basics down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775160/b7a81d8c465d17799c9e167d59ebe3328cba775a.jpg"},{"name":"Modification freak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775160/49b68f8a02063b561ea323e36e10665544848e40.jpg"},{"name":"You never skipped P.E, huh?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775160/8bb1acad9b63cf9d87874e93a4e258995085c2c0.jpg"},{"name":"A nature walk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775160/fc4ff0a813f41b0190ab79df35a53579b11a6cc4.jpg"},{"name":"You've been gnomed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775160/bebf11580329db53cf7d7ee00c1d697173b00b90.jpg"},{"name":"D\u00e9j\u00e0 vu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775160/ad108eb6b6826e53ec654c71cdd6fdc35e789ce6.jpg"},{"name":"Looking snatched","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775160/53e589a4f8e9d5b3e8cc2cf738013dd4a3597346.jpg"},{"name":"What's this?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3775160/74286f65f54c0a4278f499202f91674e4e63c7ae.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775160?t=1771509191","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/16f24e6645696c8219937d63d0c28218146b5524/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771509191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/9b3cdbe90aac67f840cfb43a680afc44854db5d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771509191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775160/9b3cdbe90aac67f840cfb43a680afc44854db5d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771509191","categories":[{"descript